title: TrainIntro
---
The passing scenery changes from spiralling concrete towers to a green sprawl gilded with fluffy trees. 
Who would have thought that last few months of turmoil would bring you here.
A new start. Littlelake.
If the name is anything to go by this new home should be small. A welcome relief from the expanse of unknown faces that, once a comfort, has turned to dread.
Cities are full of possibilities, good and bad. This place, you’re hoping, is your turn for good.
The cabin rattles as the wheels glide along the tracks.
The train screeches to a stop.
